## Decide

Present the design to the user. They can accept (optionally with
guidance for task decomposition), or abort the run.

```bash
LOOM=~/.kiro/skills/home/loomv2/scripts/loom.sh
$LOOM output init "{{ input.__loom.workdir }}" --task design-gate
$LOOM output add  "{{ input.__loom.workdir }}" --task design-gate \
    --set decision=proceed \
    --set note='<operator guidance for tasks-author, or empty>'
```

To abort (host stops driving the run; status BLOCKED):

```bash
$LOOM output add "{{ input.__loom.workdir }}" --task design-gate \
    --set decision=abort --set note='<why>'
```
